OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining showers will soon fade this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving a dry night with
OL,8,Fclear spells. Breezy initially but
OL,9,Fwinds soon easing. Becoming chilly
OL,10,Fwith a few misty patches by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,13,Fto Wednesday, but becoming
OL,14,Fincreasingly cloudy through the
OL,15,Fafternoon, though remaining dry. Winds
OL,16,Fstarting light but becoming
OL,17,Fincreasingly breezy through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
